VeridianOS: klipper: no moc include for historyitem.h

klipper/historyitem.cpp includes "moc_historyitem.cpp", but historyitem.h
declares nothing for moc (no Q_OBJECT, Q_GADGET or Q_NAMESPACE), so
AutoMoc ran moc on it for nothing: "historyitem.h: note: No relevant
classes found. No output generated." The include is removed, as upstream
master has done.

--- a/klipper/historyitem.cpp
+++ b/klipper/historyitem.cpp
@@ -66,4 +66,3 @@
     return std::make_shared<HistoryItem>(std::move(uuid), std::move(mimeTypes), std::move(text));
 }
 
-#include "moc_historyitem.cpp"
